t\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Transport</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Benefit entitlements and voucher codes.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/gifts\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Gifts</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Registry and gift links.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/reservations\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Reservations</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Venues guests can book through.</span></span></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby=\"nav-media\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Media &amp; AI\"><p id=\"nav-media\" class=\"con-index__label\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Media &amp; AI</span></p><ul class=\"list list--plain con-index__list\"><li><a href=\"/admin/media\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Media</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Moderation queue, imports and duplicates.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/ai\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Media AI</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Captions, indexing and what the model may touch.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/concierge\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Concierge</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Answer traces, grounding failures, security alerts.</span></span></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby=\"nav-operations\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Operations\"><p id=\"nav-operations\" class=\"con-index__label\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Operations</span></p><ul class=\"list list--plain con-index__list\"><li><a href=\"/admin/audit\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Audit trail</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Every action anyone took, searchable, redacted.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/jobs\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Jobs</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Queue depth, failures and retries.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/metrics\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Metrics</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">What this deployment recorded, and whether it is recording.</span></span></li><li><a href=\"/admin/providers\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Providers</span></a><span class=\"con-index__blurb\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Which adapter each integration resolved to, and what it can do.</span></span></li></ul></section></div></details></nav><main id=\"main\" class=\"ops\" data-bl-k=\"main\" data-bl-label=\"Reservable places\"><div class=\"con-head\"><div><h1 class=\"ops-title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Reservable places</span></h1><p class=\"ops-lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Restaurants and bars you recommend for the weekend, and how guests reserve a table at each.</span></p></div><div class=\"con-head__actions\"><div class=\"flow-anchor\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ops-button ops-button-primary\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Add a place</span></button><p class=\"flow-announce\" role=\"status\"></p><dialog class=\"flow-sheet\" data-tone=\"default\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_2aatpesnfkndlb_--sheet-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"dialog\"></dialog></div></div></div><section id=\"places\" class=\"ops-section\" aria-labelledby=\"places-heading\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"What guests see now\"><h2 id=\"places-heading\" class=\"ops-h2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What guests see now</span></h2><p class=\"con-note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">You have not saved any places, so guests see these built-in placeholders. Set one up, or add your own: once you save a place, the placeholders go.</span></p><ul class=\"flow-rows\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Built-in places\" data-bl-b=\"\"><li class=\"flow-row\" data-venue-id=\"caa-cindys\" data-bl-b=\"\"><div class=\"flow-row__main\"><p class=\"flow-row__title\"><span da